{"id":"d556225e5f2719e3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution.md","title":"应用项的同时替换","display":"df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution — 应用项的同时替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution","aliases":["72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution"],"display":"df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution — 应用项的同时替换","depends_on":["[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.1–2.2, print423–424/PDF435–436; local applicative syntax construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution — 应用项的同时替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03defc006c104890\" href=\"?note=03defc006c104890\" title=\"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation\">72-df-applicative-term-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.1–2.2, print423–424/PDF435–436; local applicative syntax construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X\">\\(\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in X\">\\(a\\in X\\)</span>。语法无绑定者，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span> 只替换原树中的变量，不继续替换新插入的项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(v_i):=\\theta(i),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(c_a):=c_a,\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(tu):=\\widehat\\theta(t)\\widehat\\theta(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(v_i):=\\theta(i),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(c_a):=c_a,\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(tu):=\\widehat\\theta(t)\\widehat\\theta(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限自由树递归给全定义的项变换；θ 可以有无限支持，因为每个输入项只访问有限多个变量。是否有数值是另一个由部分应用图决定的问题，不在语法替换中预先假定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-applicative-term-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"03defc006c104890","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta(v_i):=\\theta(i),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(c_a):=c_a,\\qquad\n\\widehat\\theta(tu):